              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.12+2KI.24.13+2KI.24.14+2KI.24.15+2KI.24.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bab. 24.12-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 36.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kano niko kamakhuwa ke mu barwa niyo omung'oosi Yeremia aruma khukhwama Yerusalemu khu bemeelesi be mu mbaambe, basaayi, bang'oosi ne babaandu boosi nibo Nebukadinesa ayila mu mbaambe e Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino liekholekha enyuma wo mwami Yekoniya, maawe, bakholi be mwichipi, babemeelesi ba Yuda ne Yerusalemu, babeechi ne babasi ne barurire Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebarwa yayilwa ne Elasa okhwa Siafani ne Kemaria okhwa Hilikia nibo omwami Sedekia owa Yuda aruma khu mwami Nebukadinesa owa Babiloni. Ebarwa eyo yasomwa eli:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli aboolela baboe boosi nibo aayila mu mbaambe e Babiloni khukhwama Yerusalemu ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Yombakha chinju mala mumenyemo. Lima kimikuunda mala mulie bibiaamo biakio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reera bakhasi mala musaale babaana. Lekha babaana benywe bayilane, mala babe ne babaana. Khola murio nio mutasikhe mube bakali, ne mukhaba batiiti tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali khola kamalayi khu ngoba nicho namuyilamo nga baambe. Basabile, sikila ne baindiaala mwesi mulaindiaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli mukaania enywe ndi, mukhalekha bang'oosi ne balakusi bamumenyilemo bamubea tawe. Lundi mukharekeeresia kamarooro niko baroora tawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sikila balikho bang'oola bubeeyi mu lisina liase, ne kakhali ese se nabaruma tawe.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 36.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.25.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer. 25.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.9.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan. 9.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Enyuma we kimiiko kamakhumi saba ne kiwele mu Babiloni, ndamukanakana enywe mala mukholele niko namusuubisia mala emukobosie engo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Sikila manyile kamakhuwa niko namupangila enywe, kali kamakhuwa kamalayi ne se kali ke lie bubi tawe, khumuelesia limenya ne lilieyikina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio mulandanga, mala mwiche musabe ne ese ndamuulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Likh. 4.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mulambenja mala mulanyoola, mwaba ne mumbenja ne kumwoyo kwenywe kwoosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Mulanyoola mala ese ndamukoboselia chikhabi chenywe ne khumubuusia khukhwama mu kholo choosi, ne abuundu oosi niio namuyila mwacha.” Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Ese ndamukobosia murure abuundu niio namuyila mu mbaambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila enywe mwalomile muli, ‘Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aakhueleesie bang'oosi mu Babiloni.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Khuloondekhana no mwami owe lisaaye lia Daudi, ne babaandu boosi bamenyile mu lukoba luno, balebe benywe bakhayilwa nanywe mu mbaambe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lola, ndikho mbarumira liie, enjala, ne lufu mala ndabakhola babe nga chinduli chimbi lukali nicho omundu akhanyala alia tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndabaloondiakho liie, enjala ne lufu lundi ndabakhola babiilwe ne bubwami bwe sibala sioosi, babe silaamo, babaandu bariisia be khuukwa ne khukhomwa mu kholo choosi nimwo ese nabasalanisiamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakhola ndio sikila se barekeeresia kamakhuwa kase niko ese nachiililila khubarumira khubirira khu bakholi base bang'oosi tawe, lundi enywe se mwenya khurekeeresia tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulila likhuwa lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi enywe be mu mbaambe mweesi nibo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aarusia Yerusalemu mwacha Babiloni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli aloma ali, “Khuloondekhana ne Ahabu okhwa Kolaya ne Sedekia okhwa Maaseya, balikho bang'oola bubeeyi mwisina liase. Ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ndabaana khu mwami Nebukadinesa owa Babiloni mala Nebukadinesa alabeerera ebweeni wenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila nibo, silaamo sino silarumikhwa ne baambe boosi babaama Yuda bacha Babiloni. Baliloma bali ‘Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhoya akhukhola waba nga Sedekia ne Ahabu nibo omwami owa Babiloni ooselia mu mulilo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakhabe kario sikila bakholile bubwoni mu Isiraeli, bakholile bueeyi ne bakhasi babeene mala balomile kamakhuwa ke bubeeyi niko ese khaabaruma mwisina liase tawe. Ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, niise oomanyile lundi niise owabona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebarwa eya Shemaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu Shemaya owa Nehelamu mubooleele kano: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli aloma kano: Ewe waruma chibarwa mwisina liowo khu baandu boosi baali mu Yerusalemu ne khu Sefania okhwa Maaseya omusaayi ne khu basaayi boosi ne oloma oli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aakhukholile ewe khuuba omusaayi mu bweyaangu bwo musaayi Yehoyata, khukhwimeelela enju eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, khu buli mulala owe siseecha owekhola khuuba omung'oosi ne khubara khu mitalaachi ne khubara khu makosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono siina sikila ewe ne okharafwiriire Yeremia khukhwama Anatoti oolikho okhung'oola ewe tawe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila akhurumira efwe likhuwa mu Babiloni ali, ‘Embaambe yenywe elaba endeeyi. Yombakha chinju mumenyemo, lima kimikuunda mala mulie bibiaamo biakio.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sefania omusaayi asoma ebarwa yino omung'oosi Yeremia ne arekereesie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aboolela Yeremia kamakhuwa kano: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumania likhuwa khu baandu be mu mbaambe boosi obaboolele oli, “Khuloondekhana ne Shemaya owa Nehelamu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, ‘Shemaya ang'oolile khwinywe ne kakhali ese se namurumire tawe, mala amukholile enywe mwasuubiile bubeeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako ese ndaelesia Shemaya owa Nehelamu ne lisaaye liewe siiukuumo. Se akhabe no mundu yesi yesi mu baandu bano okhamenye abone bulayi nibwo ese khakholele babaandu base tawe, sikila niye aalomaloome ke sileka khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
